    kind: work_item  # e896
    title: "help --all prints an internal default as a section heading (DEFAULT) and an internal dest name as a metavar (--path _PATH_FLAG): nothing checks that help text shows only user-facing names"  # e896
    status: todo_hard  # e896
    priority: 4  # e896
    parent:  # e896
    tags:  # e896
    - outside_reader_review_20261113  # e896
