  message: "Second outside-reader review, 2026-11-13 (self-run cache f36c63310c791188/results/c872eb7a7e793eab/ac34c56c06ec1788, re-checked on dev fed15705d7, 20 other repositories measured; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/outside_reader_review2_11142026). SAME FAMILY, proposed as a widening of this item's check (say if it should be its own item). The rendered help carries 11 distinct tracker IDs in 15 places and two internal audit labels, none of which a user can look up: WI-sihok (line 294 of hypergumbo --help --all), WI-hular (673), dispatch:F2 (712), WI-zafab (723), dispatch:F7 and WI-gavub (727), WI-sufuh (804, 831), INV-fotav (935, 1003), WI-votan (1007, 1015, 1060), WI-bifob (1019), INV-pojib (1079), INV-faput (1081), INV-fibis (1089). ADR numbers (16 mentions) name a file under docs/adr and are a different case. The check asked for here (no internal name in rendered help) would also reject the tracker-ID pattern and the dispatch: labels; the CHANGELOG already has that rule."  # cc68
